{"id":"7518a72e7d60ad45","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-prop-seifert-van-kampen.md","title":"Seifert–van Kampen Theorem","display":"prop-seifert-van-kampen — Seifert–van Kampen Theorem","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-seifert-van-kampen","aliases":["58-prop-seifert-van-kampen"],"display":"prop-seifert-van-kampen — Seifert–van Kampen Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-fundamental-group]]","[[58-df-pushout]]","[[58-df-path-connected]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-seifert-van-kampen"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-seifert-van-kampen</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-seifert-van-kampen — Seifert–van Kampen Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"58-df-fundamental-group\">58-df-fundamental-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c043773cb49e8df\" href=\"?note=3c043773cb49e8df\" title=\"58-df-pushout\">58-df-pushout</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c100dce18000d9e7\" href=\"?note=c100dce18000d9e7\" title=\"58-df-path-connected\">58-df-path-connected</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=U\\cup V\">\\(X=U\\cup V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in U\\cap V\">\\(x_0\\in U\\cap V\\)</span> (base point)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=U\\cap V\">\\(W=U\\cap V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_Y=\\{O\\cap Y:O\\in\\tau\\}\">\\(\\tau_Y=\\{O\\cap Y:O\\in\\tau\\}\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\{U,V,W\\}\">\\(Y\\in\\{U,V,W\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_U:W\\hookrightarrow U\">\\(i_U:W\\hookrightarrow U\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_V:W\\hookrightarrow V\">\\(i_V:W\\hookrightarrow V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_U:U\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(j_U:U\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_V:V\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(j_V:V\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span> are inclusions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*\">\\((i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*\\)</span> are the induced homomorphisms on based fundamental groups</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c100dce18000d9e7\" href=\"?note=c100dce18000d9e7\" title=\"58-df-path-connected\">58-df-path-connected</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\)</span> is the categorical pushout predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c043773cb49e8df\" href=\"?note=3c043773cb49e8df\" title=\"58-df-pushout\">58-df-pushout</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}seifert\\text{-}van\\text{-}kampen}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land X=U\\cup V\\land U,V\\in\\tau\n\\land W=U\\cap V\\land x_0\\in W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_U=\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_V=\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_W=\\{O\\cap W:O\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(U,\\tau_U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(V,\\tau_V)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(W,\\tau_W)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi_1(X,\\tau,x_0),(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*,(i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,\\mathbf{Grp}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}seifert\\text{-}van\\text{-}kampen}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land X=U\\cup V\\land U,V\\in\\tau\n\\land W=U\\cap V\\land x_0\\in W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_U=\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_V=\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_W=\\{O\\cap W:O\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(U,\\tau_U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(V,\\tau_V)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(W,\\tau_W)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi_1(X,\\tau,x_0),(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*,(i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,\\mathbf{Grp}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion records the actual pushout square in the category of groups, including all inclusion-induced maps; the former amalgam notation left these maps implicit and used path connectedness with the wrong arity.</li>\n<li>Seifert–van Kampen computes fundamental groups from subspaces.</li>\n<li>It is essential for computing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> of complex spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-fundamental-group","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-fundamental-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-pushout","status":"resolved","id":"3c043773cb49e8df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-pushout]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-path-connected","status":"resolved","id":"c100dce18000d9e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-path-connected]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-path-connected","status":"resolved","id":"c100dce18000d9e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S$ is the predicate from [[58-df-path-connected]] and $\\operatorname{Pushout}_S$ is the categorical pushout predicate from [[58-df-pushout]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-pushout","status":"resolved","id":"3c043773cb49e8df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S$ is the predicate from [[58-df-path-connected]] and $\\operatorname{Pushout}_S$ is the categorical pushout predicate from [[58-df-pushout]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"X=U\\cup V","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in U\\cap V","display":false},{"tex":"W=U\\cap V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_Y=\\{O\\cap Y:O\\in\\tau\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\{U,V,W\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i_U:W\\hookrightarrow U","display":false},{"tex":"i_V:W\\hookrightarrow V","display":false},{"tex":"j_U:U\\hookrightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"j_V:V\\hookrightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"(i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}seifert\\text{-}van\\text{-}kampen}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land X=U\\cup V\\land U,V\\in\\tau\n\\land W=U\\cap V\\land x_0\\in W\\\\\n&\\land\\tau_U=\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_V=\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\tau_W=\\{O\\cap W:O\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(U,\\tau_U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(V,\\tau_V)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(W,\\tau_W)\\\\\n&\\to\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi_1(X,\\tau,x_0),(j_U)_*,(j_V)_*,(i_U)_*,(i_V)_*,\\mathbf{Grp}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false}],"bytes":2078,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3993","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-prop-seifert-van-kampen.md|58-prop-seifert-van-kampen]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","3c043773cb49e8df","c100dce18000d9e7"]}